{"timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:09:40.069Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"修复点会放在 AI 的出口清场分支，而不是角色碰撞参数上。具体做法是：清场后如果短时间没有推进，就进入一个可持续的 `clear_exit` 绕路目标；这个目标会避开当前卡住的下一格，并且先用 `test_move` 检查从当前物理位置迈出的第一步是否可走。","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:09:40.069Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"修复点会放在 AI 的出口清场分支，而不是角色碰撞参数上。具体做法是：清场后如果短时间没有推进，就进入一个可持续的 `clear_exit` 绕路目标；这个目标会避开当前卡住的下一格，并且先用 `test_move` 检查从当前物理位置迈出的第一步是否可走。"}],"phase":"commentary"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:09:50.987Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1UOMgrTtmcI3umv8f6JL9OTy","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/godot-2d-treasure/scripts/main.gd\n@@\n const CODEX_AI_DETOUR_REACHED_DISTANCE := 18.0\n const CODEX_AI_DETOUR_MIN_DISTANCE := 64.0\n const CODEX_AI_DETOUR_SEARCH_RADIUS := 9\n const CODEX_AI_CLEAR_EXIT_STEP_DISTANCE := 44.0\n+const CODEX_AI_CLEAR_EXIT_DETOUR_AFTER_NUDGES := 2\n const CODEX_AI_ATTACK_RECOVERY_TIME := 0.95\n@@\n \tif _codex_ai_exit_is_clear():\n-\t\t_codex_ai_clear_detour(\"exit_clear\")\n \t\t_codex_ai_clear_attack_recovery(\"exit_clear\")\n+\t\tif _codex_ai_has_active_detour() and codex_ai_detour_reason.begins_with(\"clear_exit\"):\n+\t\t\tcodex_ai_move_target = codex_ai_detour_target\n+\t\t\tcodex_ai_goal = \"clear_exit_detour\"\n+\t\t\t_codex_ai_strategy_log_event(\"follow_clear_exit_detour\", {\n+\t\t\t\t\"target\": {\"x\": codex_ai_move_target.x, \"y\": codex_ai_move_target.y},\n+\t\t\t\t\"timer\": codex_ai_detour_timer,\n+\t\t\t\t\"nudge_count\": codex_ai_clear_exit_nudge_count\n+\t\t\t})\n+\t\t\treturn\n+\t\t_codex_ai_clear_detour(\"exit_clear\")\n \t\tcodex_ai_move_target = _codex_ai_clear_exit_step_target()\n \t\tcodex_ai_goal = \"go_to_exit_clear\"\n@@\n \tif _codex_ai_exit_is_clear():\n \t\tcodex_ai_clear_exit_nudge_count += 1\n-\t\t_codex_ai_clear_detour(\"clear_exit_progress\")\n+\t\t_codex_ai_clear_detour(\"clear_exit_progress\")\n \t\t_codex_ai_clear_attack_recovery(\"clear_exit_progress\")\n-\t\tvar step_position := _codex_ai_clear_exit_step_target()\n-\t\tcodex_ai_move_target = step_position\n-\t\tcodex_ai_goal = \"clear_exit_recover\"\n+\t\tvar step_position := _codex_ai_clear_exit_step_target()\n+\t\tvar recovery_kind := \"step\"\n+\t\tif codex_ai_clear_exit_nudge_count >= CODEX_AI_CLEAR_EXIT_DETOUR_AFTER_NUDGES:\n+\t\t\tstep_position = _codex_ai_pick_clear_exit_recovery_position()\n+\t\t\t_codex_ai_start_detour(\"clear_exit_progress\", step_position)\n+\t\t\trecovery_kind = \"detour\"\n+\t\telse:\n+\t\t\tcodex_ai_move_target = step_position\n+\t\t\tcodex_ai_goal = \"clear_exit_recover\"\n \t\t_codex_ai_strategy_log_event(\"clear_exit_recovery\", {\n \t\t\t\"distance\": distance,\n \t\t\t\"no_progress_timer\": codex_ai_no_progress_timer,\n+\t\t\t\"kind\": recovery_kind,\n \t\t\t\"nudge_count\": codex_ai_clear_exit_nudge_count,\n \t\t\t\"target\": {\"x\": codex_ai_move_target.x, \"y\": codex_ai_move_target.y}\n \t\t})\n@@\n func _codex_ai_clear_exit_step_target() -> Vector2:\n \tif not exit_area or not is_instance_valid(exit_area):\n \t\treturn player.global_position\n@@\n \treturn next_position\n \n \n+func _codex_ai_pick_clear_exit_recovery_position() -> Vector2:\n+\tif world_grid.is_empty() or not exit_area or not is_instance_valid(exit_area):\n+\t\treturn _nearest_walkable_escape_position()\n+\tvar current := _nearest_walkable_cell(_world_cell_for_position(player.global_position))\n+\tvar goal := _nearest_walkable_cell(_world_cell_for_position(exit_area.global_position))\n+\tvar blocked_first_step := _next_path_cell(current, goal)\n+\tvar current_exit_distance := player.global_position.distance_to(exit_area.global_position)\n+\tvar best_cell := current\n+\tvar best_score := -INF\n+\tfor radius in range(2, CODEX_AI_DETOUR_SEARCH_RADIUS + 3):\n+\t\tfor y in range(current.y - radius, current.y + radius + 1):\n+\t\t\tfor x in range(current.x - radius, current.x + radius + 1):\n+\t\t\t\tvar cell := Vector2i(x, y)\n+\t\t\t\tif not _is_walkable_cell(cell) or cell == current:\n+\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n+\t\t\t\tvar position := _cell_center(cell)\n+\t\t\t\tif player.global_position.distance_to(position) < CODEX_AI_DETOUR_MIN_DISTANCE:\n+\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n+\t\t\t\tvar first_step := _next_path_cell(current, cell)\n+\t\t\t\tif first_step == current:\n+\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n+\t\t\t\tvar first_direction := _cell_center(first_step) - player.global_position\n+\t\t\t\tif first_direction.length_squared() <= 0.0 or _codex_ai_direction_blocked(first_direction.normalized()):\n+\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n+\t\t\t\tvar path_to_exit := _next_path_cell(cell, goal)\n+\t\t\t\tif path_to_exit == cell and cell != goal:\n+\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n+\t\t\t\tvar candidate_exit_distance := position.distance_to(exit_area.global_position)\n+\t\t\t\tvar progress_gain := current_exit_distance - candidate_exit_distance\n+\t\t\t\tvar score := progress_gain * 2.6 + player.global_position.distance_to(position) * 0.12\n+\t\t\t\tif first_step == blocked_first_step and codex_ai_clear_exit_nudge_count >= CODEX_AI_CLEAR_EXIT_DETOUR_AFTER_NUDGES:\n+\t\t\t\t\tscore -= 260.0\n+\t\t\t\tif candidate_exit_distance > current_exit_distance + TILE_SIZE:\n+\t\t\t\t\tscore -= 180.0\n+\t\t\t\tif score > best_score:\n+\t\t\t\t\tbest_score = score\n+\t\t\t\t\tbest_cell = cell\n+\tif best_cell == current:\n+\t\treturn _codex_ai_pick_detour_position()\n+\treturn _cell_center(best_cell)\n+\n+\n func _codex_ai_next_path_center() -> Vector2:\n*** End Patch\n"}}
