{"timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:20:50.631Z","type":"compacted","payload":{"message":"","replacement_history":[{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Godot 4 + VSCode + Codex + Git，开始搭建这个工作模式\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"安装godot4\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Godot 4 + VSCode + Codex + Git，开始搭建这个工作模式可以使用了吗\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"继续\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"用这套工作流完成一个简单的3D 滚珠迷宫游戏\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"如何打开玩\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"[@电脑](plugin://computer-use@openai-bundled) 打开游戏\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"在godot资源库中下载一个女性角色，和地图资源，并将其放入地图中，通过键盘能够控制角色自由走动，跳跃\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"用户使用鼠标可以换视角角度，其次人物没有行走的骨骼动作；将地牢地图扩大成10个房间。\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"增加地图面积，减少墙的厚度。\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"地图扩大到200*200，房间扩大到30米\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"重新打开游戏\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"查看游戏查找游戏问题，并修复，角色行走方向有问题，游戏地图有问题\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"角色前进方向应该是跟镜头方向相反，目前看起来角色在倒退；其次，需要在这么大地图中完成地牢房间搭建，目前是空旷的\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"在godot的库中下载其他更大的成熟地图，替换现在的地图\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"再新增一个地图，在原来地图中增加一个传送门，角色进入传送门后可以从新地图传送门出来到新地图；角色通过传送门也可回到原地图\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"下载另一个地图，使用另外的传送门传送\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":